 "story": "Liverpool drew 0-0 with Fulham at Anfield in the Premier League, a result that left them sixth in the table. There were no goals in the first half, and Milos Kerkez replaced Kostas Tsimikas for Liverpool at half-time. Cody Gakpo and Alexis Mac Allister came on in the 60th minute for Víctor Muñoz and Ryan Gravenberch. Rio Ngumoha and Jeremie Frimpong followed in the 72nd minute for Bradley Barcola and Ronald Araujo. Fulham, who made five changes between the 63rd and 77th minutes, saw Kenny Tete booked in the 81st minute, and Liverpool had no bookings. Liverpool had 56.1% of possession and 14 shots to Fulham's 10, but Fulham had four shots on target to Liverpool's three.",
